Blend together @avocado{1}, @cucumber{1}, @Greek yogurt{150%g}, @mustard{1/2%tsp}, and a few leaves of @mint{}. Add @salt{} and @black pepper{} to taste.

Serve cold. Garnish with mint and a splash of @Tabasco sauce{}.